======================================================================
  Architecture Diagram: Phase 149 - Outbound Webhook Delivery Platform
======================================================================

1. Simplest Baseline Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Calling external customer webhook URLs synchronously inside order checkout handler.

   [Client] ──▶ [Application Server] ──▶ [Primary Datastore]


2. Scaled / Resilient Architecture:
----------------------------------------------------------------------
   Dedicated webhook worker pool with per-domain rate limiting, HMAC-SHA256 signatures, and DLQs.

                               ┌──▶ [Worker Node A] ──┬──▶ [Cache]
[Client] ──▶ [Load Balancer] ──┼──▶ [Worker Node B] ──┤
                               └──▶ [Worker Node C] ──┴──▶ [Primary DB] ──▶ [Replicas]
                                         │
                                         ▼
                                   [Event Queue] ──▶ [Async Workers]

======================================================================
